.     * set the ster file name and the notes to be included
.     local ster_name "`reg_folder'/interacted_reg_`reg'_2026_lrt.ster"
{txt} 74{com}.     local spec_desc "rcspline, 3 knots (27 28 41), tmax, differentiated treatment withlr interaction, fe = $fe, reg_type = `reg'"
