{txt} 76{com}.     loc weight "rep_unit_year_sample_wgt"
{txt} 77{com}. 
.     di "reghdfe mins_worked `reg_treatment' `reg_control' [pweight = `weight'], absorb(`reg_fe') vce(cl cluster_adm1yymm)"
{txt} 78{com}.     reghdfe mins_worked `reg_treatment' `reg_control' [pweight = `weight'], absorb(`reg_fe') vce(cl cluster_adm1yymm)
{txt} 79{com}. 
.     * count regression N by risk
